RULE 4: Safety Compliance. Applicant must possess a "Satisfactory" safety rating or better.
RULE 5: Incident Disclosure. Any reference to an "Incident Class A" in the applicant's record requires a formal waiver from the Department of Transportation.
  -> Note: See Section 8.2 for the classification matrix determining if an incident is Class A.

